    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370490/extras/d559d31fbd357f21cfa235bad527f44b.avif?t=1749514691\" width=600 height=245 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Giggleland! Join Tolie on her very special day at the park as she searches for her missing father.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore our wonderful attractions, meet our ever-smiling staff, and experience the magic that makes Giggleland the happiest place in the world! Just remember - every guest must follow the rules. The Management is very particular about that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370490/extras/4144b0792e8d24aec9ce519f3504afa9.avif?t=1749514691\" width=600 height=245 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through themed areas filled with colorful characters and hidden passages, each holding pieces of the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve intricate puzzles throughout the park - after all, good children follow directions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a story of family, belonging, and the true cost of endless happiness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The park is waiting. Will you join us?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370490/extras/d559d31fbd357f21cfa235bad527f44b.avif?t=1749514691\" width=600 height=245 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Giggleland! Join Tolie on her very special day at the park as she searches for her missing father.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore our wonderful attractions, meet our ever-smiling staff, and experience the magic that makes Giggleland the happiest place in the world! Just remember - every guest must follow the rules. The Management is very particular about that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370490/extras/4144b0792e8d24aec9ce519f3504afa9.avif?t=1749514691\" width=600 height=245 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through themed areas filled with colorful characters and hidden passages, each holding pieces of the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve intricate puzzles throughout the park - after all, good children follow directions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a story of family, belonging, and the true cost of endless happiness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The park is waiting. Will you join us?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
